      "reasoning_content": "我们 need answer as JSON. Need reason in Chinese. Need analyze.\n\nWe need judge if Live fulfills query \"查找上个月成交的客户\" (find customers who closed deals last month). Live condition: customerType MATCH \"客户\" only. Reference: dealDate RANGE 2026-07-01 to 2026-07-31. Obviously Live fails core constraint \"上个月成交\" (deal date last month). It only filters customerType=客户, not deal date. Need verdict not_fulfilled. Confidence high.\n\nNeed mention evidence: query explicitly has 上个月成交, Live lacks dealDate. reference has date range. case_local_implementation_evidence says dealDate range rule exists but Live didn't use it. Need note this is not just extra narrowing? It's missing core constraint. Also Live's customerType MATCH 客户 is not harmful but insufficient. It also may be broad: all customers type 客户, not just those with deal in last month. So not fulfilled.\n\nNeed output JSON with verdict reason confidence. Must be valid. No markdown. Let's craft concise.",
